  "cells": [
    {"cell_type": "markdown", "metadata": {"id": "title"}, "source": [
      "# AWF — Compress & Chat with Any LLM\n\n",
      "**Compress any LLM 2-4× and chat with it. REAL file compression. Instruct models for real chat.**\n\n",
      "## What This Does\n",
      "1. Downloads a pre-trained **instruct model** (already fluent, already knows how to chat)\n",
      "2. Compresses it with AWF (SVD + int8 — **REAL file size reduction**)\n",
      "3. Chats with the compressed model — generates coherent responses\n",
      "4. Saves the compressed model (genuinely smaller .pt file)\n",
      "5. Optional: Export for Ollama\n\n",
      "## Supported Models\n\n",
      "| Model | Type | Params | Compressed | RAM | Token? |\n",
      "|-------|------|--------|------------|-----|--------|\n",
      "| Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B-Instruct | Chat | 1.5B | ~400 MB | 4 GB | No |\n",
      "| microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct | Chat | 3.8B | ~1 GB | 8 GB | No |\n",
      "| THUDM/glm-4-9b-chat | Chat | 9B | ~2.5 GB | 8 GB | No |\n",
      "| deepseek-ai/deepseek-llm-7b-chat | Chat | 7B | ~2 GB | 8 GB | No |\n",
      "| mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 | Chat | 7B | ~2 GB | 8 GB | Yes |\n",
      "| Qwen/Qwen2-7B-Instruct | Chat | 7B | ~2 GB | 8 GB | No |\n",
      "| meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct | Chat | 8B | ~2.2 GB | 8 GB | Yes |\n",
      "\n",
      "## Time\n",
      "- Small models (1.5B): 5-10 minutes on Colab T4\n",
      "- Medium models (7-9B): 15-30 minutes on Colab T4"
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {"id": "setup"}, "outputs": [], "source": [
      "# @title Setup\n",
      "!git clone https://github.com/Deexv/AWF.git 2>/dev/null || true\n",
      "%cd AWF\n",
      "!pip install -q -r requirements.txt transformers\n",
      "\n",
      "import torch, sys, os\n",
      "sys.path.insert(0, '.'); sys.path.insert(0, 'scripts')\n",
      "print(f'PyTorch: {torch.__version__}')\n",
      "print(f'CUDA: {torch.cuda.is_available()}')\n",
      "if torch.cuda.is_available():\n",
      "    print(f'GPU: {torch.cuda.get_device_name(0)}')"
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "markdown", "metadata": {"id": "step1"}, "source": [
      "## Step 1: List Available Models"
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {"id": "list"}, "outputs": [], "source": [
      "!python scripts/chat_real.py --list"
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "markdown", "metadata": {"id": "step2"}, "source": [
      "## Step 2: Compress a Model and Save It\n\n",
      "Pick any model from the list above. **For real chat, use Instruct models** (not base).\n\n",
      "Recommended starting points:\n",
      "- `Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B-Instruct` — small, fast, good chat quality\n",
      "- `microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct` — slightly bigger, better quality\n",
      "- `THUDM/glm-4-9b-chat` — GLM-4, Chinese + English\n",
      "- `deepseek-ai/deepseek-llm-7b-chat` — DeepSeek chat model"
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {"id": "compress"}, "outputs": [], "source": [
      "# @title Compress model and save\n",
      "model_name = 'Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B-Instruct'  # @param ['Qwen/Qwen2-1.5B-Instruct', 'microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct', 'THUDM/glm-4-9b-chat', 'deepseek-ai/deepseek-llm-7b-chat', 'distilgpt2', 'gpt2']\n",
      "keep_ratio = 0.85  # @param {type:'slider', min:0.5, max:0.95, step:0.05}\n",
      "\n",
      "import torch, sys, os\n",
      "sys.path.insert(0, '.'); sys.path.insert(0, 'scripts')\n",
      "from chat_real import compress_and_store, save_compressed_model\n",
      "from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer\n",
      "\n",
      "device = 'cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu'\n",
      "print(f'Loading {model_name}...')\n",
      "tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name, trust_remote_code=True)\n",
      "model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_name, torch_dtype=torch.float32, trust_remote_code=True).to(device)\n",
      "model.eval()\n",
      "\n",
      "n_params = sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters())\n",
      "orig_size = n_params * 4 / 1024 / 1024\n",
      "print(f'Original: {n_params:,} params ({n_params/1e6:.1f}M), {orig_size:.1f} MB')\n",
      "\n",
      "# Compress\n",
      "print(f'\\nCompressing (keep_ratio={keep_ratio})...')\n",
      "compressed_data, ratio = compress_and_store(model, keep_ratio=keep_ratio)\n",
      "\n",
      "# Save\n",
      "save_name = model_name.replace('/', '_') + '_compressed.pt'\n",
      "save_path = f'checkpoints/{save_name}'\n",
      "actual_size = save_compressed_model(model, compressed_data, model_name, save_path)\n",
      "actual_mb = actual_size / 1024 / 1024\n",
      "\n",
      "print(f'\\n✅ Saved to {save_path}')\n",
      "print(f'   Original: {orig_size:.1f} MB')\n",
      "print(f'   Compressed file: {actual_mb:.1f} MB')\n",
      "print(f'   ACTUAL compression: {orig_size / actual_mb:.1f}x')\n",
      "print(f'   RAM needed: ~{actual_mb / 1024 + 0.5:.1f} GB')"
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "markdown", "metadata": {"id": "step3"}, "source": [
      "## Step 3: Chat with the Compressed Model\n\n",
      "The compressed model uses proper chat templates (instruct models) for coherent Q&A."
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {"id": "chat_test"}, "outputs": [], "source": [
      "# @title Generate from compressed model\n",
      "prompt = 'What is the capital of France?'  # @param {type:'string'}\n",
      "max_tokens = 200  # @param {type:'integer'}\n",
      "\n",
      "is_instruct = 'instruct' in model_name.lower() or 'chat' in model_name.lower()\n",
      "\n",
      "if is_instruct and hasattr(tokenizer, 'apply_chat_template'):\n",
      "    messages = [{'role': 'user', 'content': prompt}]\n",
      "    text = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(messages, tokenize=False, add_generation_prompt=True)\n",
      "    input_ids = tokenizer.encode(text, return_tensors='pt').to(device)\n",
      "else:\n",
      "    input_ids = tokenizer.encode(prompt, return_tensors='pt').to(device)\n",
      "\n",
      "with torch.no_grad():\n",
      "    output = model.generate(input_ids, max_new_tokens=max_tokens,\n",
      "                            temperature=0.7, top_k=50, do_sample=True,\n",
      "                            pad_token_id=tokenizer.eos_token_id or 0,\n",
      "                            repetition_penalty=1.2)\n",
      "\n",
      "response = tokenizer.decode(output[0], skip_special_tokens=True)\n",
      "if is_instruct:\n",
      "    # Extract assistant response\n",
      "    for marker in ['<|im_start|>assistant', 'assistant']:\n",
      "        if marker in response:\n",
      "            response = response.split(marker)[-1].strip()\n",
      "            for end_marker in ['<|im_end|>', '<|end|>', '</s>']:\n",
      "                if end_marker in response:\n",
      "                    response = response.split(end_marker)[0].strip()\n",
      "            break\n",
      "else:\n",
      "    if response.startswith(prompt):\n",
      "        response = response[len(prompt):].strip()\n",
      "\n",
      "print(response)"
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {"id": "chat_multi"}, "outputs": [], "source": [
      "# @title Try multiple prompts\n",
      "prompts = [\n",
      "    'What is the capital of France?',\n",
      "    'Write a short poem about autumn.',\n",
      "    'Explain how a computer works to a 5-year-old.',\n",
      "    'What are 3 tips for staying healthy?',\n",
      "]\n",
      "\n",
      "for p in prompts:\n",
      "    print(f'\\n{\"=\"*50}')\n",
      "    print(f'You: {p}')\n",
      "    if is_instruct and hasattr(tokenizer, 'apply_chat_template'):\n",
      "        messages = [{'role': 'user', 'content': p}]\n",
      "        text = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(messages, tokenize=False, add_generation_prompt=True)\n",
      "        input_ids = tokenizer.encode(text, return_tensors='pt').to(device)\n",
      "    else:\n",
      "        input_ids = tokenizer.encode(p, return_tensors='pt').to(device)\n",
      "\n",
      "    with torch.no_grad():\n",
      "        output = model.generate(input_ids, max_new_tokens=150,\n",
      "                                temperature=0.7, top_k=50, do_sample=True,\n",
      "                                pad_token_id=tokenizer.eos_token_id or 0,\n",
      "                                repetition_penalty=1.2)\n",
      "\n",
      "    response = tokenizer.decode(output[0], skip_special_tokens=True)\n",
      "    if is_instruct:\n",
      "        for marker in ['<|im_start|>assistant', 'assistant']:\n",
      "            if marker in response:\n",
      "                response = response.split(marker)[-1].strip()\n",
      "                for end_marker in ['<|im_end|>', '<|end|>', '</s>']:\n",
      "                    if end_marker in response:\n",
      "                        response = response.split(end_marker)[0].strip()\n",
      "                break\n",
      "    else:\n",
      "        if response.startswith(p):\n",
      "            response = response[len(p):].strip()\n",
      "\n",
      "    print(f'AI: {response}')"
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "markdown", "metadata": {"id": "step4"}, "source": [
      "## Step 4: Interactive Chat\n\n",
      "Type your own prompts and get responses."
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {"id": "interactive"}, "outputs": [], "source": [
      "print('=' * 50)\n",
      "print(f'  Chat with compressed {model_name}')\n",
      "print(f'  Type quit to exit')\n",
      "print('=' * 50)\n",
      "\n",
      "while True:\n",
      "    user = input('\\nYou> ').strip()\n",
      "    if user.lower() in ('quit', 'exit', 'q'):\n",
      "        break\n",
      "    if not user:\n",
      "        continue\n",
      "\n",
      "    if is_instruct and hasattr(tokenizer, 'apply_chat_template'):\n",
      "        messages = [{'role': 'user', 'content': user}]\n",
      "        text = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(messages, tokenize=False, add_generation_prompt=True)\n",
      "        input_ids = tokenizer.encode(text, return_tensors='pt').to(device)\n",
      "    else:\n",
      "        input_ids = tokenizer.encode(user, return_tensors='pt').to(device)\n",
      "\n",
      "    with torch.no_grad():\n",
      "        output = model.generate(input_ids, max_new_tokens=200,\n",
      "                                temperature=0.7, top_k=50, do_sample=True,\n",
      "                                pad_token_id=tokenizer.eos_token_id or 0,\n",
      "                                repetition_penalty=1.2)\n",
      "\n",
      "    response = tokenizer.decode(output[0], skip_special_tokens=True)\n",
      "    if is_instruct:\n",
      "        for marker in ['<|im_start|>assistant', 'assistant']:\n",
      "            if marker in response:\n",
      "                response = response.split(marker)[-1].strip()\n",
      "                for end_marker in ['<|im_end|>', '<|end|>', '</s>']:\n",
      "                    if end_marker in response:\n",
      "                        response = response.split(end_marker)[0].strip()\n",
      "                break\n",
      "    else:\n",
      "        if response.startswith(user):\n",
      "            response = response[len(user):].strip()\n",
      "\n",
      "    print(f'AI> {response}')"
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "markdown", "metadata": {"id": "step5"}, "source": [
      "## Step 5: Export for Ollama (Optional)\n\n",
      "Export the compressed model so you can use it with [Ollama](https://ollama.ai)."
    ]},
    {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {"id": "ollama"}, "outputs": [], "source": [
      "# @title Export for Ollama\n",
      "from chat_real import export_to_ollama\n",
      "\n",
      "output_dir = f'ollama_{model_name.split(\"/\")[-1]}'\n",
      "export_to_ollama(model, tokenizer, model_name, output_dir)\n",
      "\n",
      "print(f'\\nTo use with Ollama:')\n",
      "print(f'1. Install Ollama: https://ollama.ai')\n",
      "print(f'2. Convert to GGUF (needs llama.cpp):')\n",
      "print(f'   !pip install llama-cpp-python')\n",
      "print(f'   !python -m llama_cpp.convert {output_dir} --outtype q8_0 --outfile {output_dir}/model.gguf')\n",
      "print(f'3. Create Modelfile:')\n",
      f'   !ollama create {model_name.split(\"/\")[-1].lower()}-awf -f {output_dir}/Modelfile')\n",
      "print(f'4. Run:')\n",
      f'   !ollama run {model_name.split(\"/\")[-1].lower()}-awf')"
    ]},
